// N2 weapon-dispatcher evidence fixture (docs/contracts/normal-play-
// integration.md "Weapon dispatcher"). Fixture-only, not the manual
// default: when 1 under ds_p030_mode manual/soak_n2, grants one of every
// draftable base weapon at rank 1 through the real AcquireWeapon dispatcher
// shortly after boot, then ranks each to max through SetWeaponRank over the
// run, so every dispatcher-routed engine can be exercised in one soak.
nosave int ds_n2_grant_all = 0;
// N2 per-engine wall-time profiling probe (this task's item 1). Off by
// default; when 1, ProcessOwnedWeapons() and the other LogicalTic phases
// measure their own wall time with MSTimeF() and print one
// DS_N2_PROFILE_TIC line per logical tic. Diagnostic-only: it never changes
// hit decisions, ordering, RNG streams or damage, only whether timing lines
// are printed.
nosave int ds_n2_profile = 0;
// N2-W5 evolution/chest evidence fixture (docs/contracts/normal-play-
// integration.md "Evolutions and chests"). Fixture-only, not the manual
// default: when 1 under ds_p030_mode manual/soak_n2, shortens the interim
// chest cadence from 2100 tics (60s, INTERIM_CHEST_CADENCE) to 105 tics so a
// short soak can exercise every recipe; the fixture MAP16 route additionally
// grants every recipe's inputs at max rank. Never changes chest ledger
// rules, recipe eligibility or the dispatcher's EvolveWeapon routing.
nosave int ds_n2_evolve_fixture = 0;
// N2-W7 normal-flow soak evidence (docs/contracts/normal-play-integration.md
// "Evidence (N2 acceptance)" item 2). Off by default, never set by the
// default manual launcher route. When 1 under ds_p030_mode manual/soak_n2,
// a labelled deterministic choice policy (N2DraftBotTick/N2DraftBotScore,
// classification N2_DRAFT_BOT) answers each real level-up modal through the
// same ApplyChoice acceptance path the player's own UI/network-event input
// uses (source="N2_DRAFT_BOT" instead of "NETWORK_EVENT"/"PHYSICAL_KEY"):
// it never bypasses DSP031ApplyOffer/the real offer legality, chest cadence
// or recipe rules. Policy order: (a) an unowned weapon while ordinary
// weapon slots remain, (b) an unowned passive some owned weapon's real
// evolution/union recipe needs, (c) ranking an already-owned weapon toward
// its max rank, then any remaining offer (including the GOLD/CHICKEN
// fallback) lowest.
nosave int ds_n2_draft_bot = 0;
// N2-W7 soak-only XP acceleration fixture (same evidence item). Off by
// default (1000 = no change, milli-scale multiplier applied to
// CollectRunExperience's real amount before it reaches the real P031/P028
// XP ledger and level-curve thresholds -- it accelerates real XP collection
// events, it does not grant levels, weapons or draft choices directly).
// Labelled N2_XP_ACCELERATION_FIXTURE in the log; never set by the default
// manual launcher route.
nosave int ds_n2_xp_multiplier_milli = 1000;
// N2-W8 soak-only autonomous mover (N2_SOAK_MOVER, amended N2 acceptance
// item 2). Off by default. Each logical/world tic it steers the real
// player body toward the nearest live XP pickup (fallback: the active
// interim chest) using the same real P021 body-movement path P032's
// MAP16 movement tape already exercises (players[0].cmd injection +
// DSP021FirstPersonPlayer.MovePlayer()) -- it never teleports the player
// or fabricates position. Paired with ds_n2_draft_bot for soak evidence.
nosave int ds_n2_soak_mover = 0;
// N2-W9 manual-route save/load evidence (docs/contracts/normal-play-
